⚡🇷🇺 Exclusive footage published by Russian war correspondent Alexander Rogatkin reportedly shows a Russian combat laser system engaging Ukrainian drones in operational conditions.

According to the report, several such laser systems are now protecting strategic facilities in southwestern Russia, with their developers claiming that they have already destroyed several hundred Ukrainian UAVs. More powerful second-generation systems are reportedly beginning to replace the initial installations, with developers claiming the newer weapons will be capable of engaging higher-speed targets, including aircraft and cruise missiles.

